{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026aX3kq2MaHM1793353173.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>張彥博近日飛抵美國紐約，並於社交平台分享前往著名學府紐約大學的打卡照片。期間，他更約見正在當地修讀音樂商業課程的「聲夢小花」姚焯菲（Chantel）聚會敘舊。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c08f589a-1711-4705-b4a8-95ce5aaac860.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026cNBhwDRjmy1793353174.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9aaa8c27-c2bb-4405-9db6-0f6154793ee7.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026GO5cqte3Fn1793353174.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>從照片可見，染了一頭醒目灰銀髮色的張彥博，身穿黑色高領上衣及深色外套，於紐約大學標誌性的門牌前留影。隨後，他與姚焯菲一同前往當地的戶外 Café 享用輕食與咖啡。姚焯菲當日身穿灰色針織外套配搭牛仔褲，造型簡約自然，且只化了淡妝，顯得非常溫柔。</p><h3></h3></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:19.527582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.586435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:49.528436+00:00","content_hash":"07a4b134e06e708b7d21be97ada0fda55ba2b917883d751e9c97d0443526be6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:19.527582+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}